      "body": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"BA Insight Platform Knowledge Domain Index\"\ndomain: \"ba-insight\"\ncategory: \"work\"\ntype: \"hub\"\ntags: [\"ba-insight\", \"index\", \"moc\"]\ncreated: 2026-08-18\nupdated: 2026-08-18\nstatus: active\nsummary: \"Map of Content for the overarching BA Insight Platform: enterprise architecture, REST API reference, diagnostics, logging, licensing, and administration.\"\n---\n\n# BA Insight Platform Knowledge Domain\n\nOverarching architecture, platform services, developer REST APIs, and diagnostic governance for the BA Insight suite.\n\n---\n\n## Core Wiki Notes\n\n### 1. Platform Architecture & Developer APIs\n- **[[platform-architecture]]** \u2014 End-to-end platform topology, component integration, and product suite communication.\n- **[[api-reference-and-services]]** \u2014 Full REST API reference for Search, NLQ, Conversational, Analytics, and Document Loader services.\n- **[[platform-vision-and-strategy]]** \u2014 Enterprise search evolution, generative AI roadmap, and product strategy.\n\n### 2. Operations, Deployment & Governance\n- **[[diagnostics-and-logging-framework]]** \u2014 Unified logging framework, Log4Net configuration, performance counters, diagnostic tools.\n- **[[licensing-and-deployment]]** \u2014 Multi-server topology, hardware sizing, licensing models, SSL/TLS certificate setup.\n- **[[licensing]]** \u2014 License key provisioning, validation checks, and feature entitlement policies.\n- **[[unified-admin-and-configuration]]** \u2014 Administration console, centralized configuration management, settings import/export.\n- **[[configuration-and-troubleshooting]]** \u2014 System health checks, connection validation, common failure triage.\n"
