      "body": "# BlanketDesignGenerator Project Roadmap\n\n## Milestone Overview\n\n```mermaid\ngantt\n    title BlanketDesignGenerator Development Phases\n    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD\n    section Phase 1: Core Engine\n    PWA Shell & Grid Generator    :done, 2026-01-01, 2026-03-01\n    Adjacency Balancing Algorithm :done, 2026-02-15, 2026-03-15\n    section Phase 2: Advanced Design\n    Photo-to-Palette Extractor   :active, 2026-03-15, 2026-04-30\n    Interactive Drag-and-Drop    :active, 2026-04-01, 2026-05-15\n    Border Generator & Yardage   :2026-05-01, 2026-06-15\n    section Phase 3: Export & Cloud\n    Written Pattern PDF Compiler :2026-06-01, 2026-07-15\n    Google Drive / Cloud Sync    :2026-07-01, 2026-08-15\n    section Phase 4: Native Mobile\n    Capacitor iOS/Android Bundle :2026-08-01, 2026-09-30\n    IAP & Store Publishing       :2026-09-15, 2026-10-31\n```\n\n---\n\n## Development Phases & Deliverables\n\n### Phase 1: Core Foundation & Grid Generator *(Completed)*\n- [x] Responsive PWA layout with mobile-first CSS design tokens.\n- [x] Dynamic grid generator ($M \\times N$ matrix) with color randomization.\n- [x] Basic adjacency checking algorithm to avoid adjacent identical colors.\n- [x] Service worker offline caching and manifest setup.\n\n### Phase 2: Advanced Design & Interactivity *(Current Focus)*\n- [x] Multi-round classic granny square renderer.\n- [ ] Photo-to-palette extractor using median-cut / k-means Canvas algorithm.\n- [ ] Drag-and-drop tile swapping with fluid touch micro-interactions.\n- [ ] Border designer (inner/outer round depths and stitch patterns).\n- [ ] Yarn yardage & safety buffer calculator.\n\n### Phase 3: Export & Cloud Synchronization\n- [ ] Configure Google OAuth Consent Screen Pretty App Name (\"Blanket Design Generator\") in Google Cloud Console to remove hash from login popup title.\n- [ ] Written assembly instruction generator (US/UK stitch conventions).\n- [ ] High-resolution vector PDF export with color charts.\n- [ ] Google Drive AppData synchronization for cross-device design persistence.\n- [ ] Shareable design URLs with read-only view state.\n\n### Phase 4: Cross-Platform Native Mobile & App Store Launch\n- [ ] Capacitor 6.x packaging for iOS and Android.\n- [ ] In-App Purchases (IAP) integration for Pro unlocks.\n- [ ] Non-intrusive AdMob banner ads on free tiers.\n- [ ] App Store and Google Play Store metadata and asset publishing."
