      "body": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"ConnectivityHub Knowledge Domain Index\"\ndomain: \"connectivity-hub\"\ncategory: \"work\"\ntype: \"hub\"\ntags: [\"connectivity-hub\", \"index\", \"moc\"]\ncreated: 2026-08-18\nupdated: 2026-08-18\nstatus: active\nsummary: \"Map of Content for ConnectivityHub: ingestion architecture, 50+ enterprise connector catalog, technical configs, custom scripting, crawl management, and security trimming.\"\n---\n\n# ConnectivityHub Knowledge Domain\n\nConnectivityHub is the enterprise ingestion backbone of the BA Insight platform.\n\n---\n\n## Core Wiki Notes\n\n### 1. Framework Architecture & Operations\n- **[[framework-and-architecture]]** \u2014 System topology, CrawlQueue engine, SQL database schemas, FIPS compliance.\n- **[[crawl-management-and-scheduling]]** \u2014 Crawl types, scheduling, CrawlQueue REST API, multi-threaded worker pools.\n- **[[source-system-definitions]]** \u2014 Content source modeling, crawling boundaries, MIME type handlers.\n\n### 2. Connectors & Technical References\n- **[[connector-catalog]]** \u2014 Complete matrix of 50+ enterprise connectors across Legal, Cloud, CRM, and Databases.\n- **[[enterprise-connectors-reference]]** \u2014 Deep technical reference for SharePoint, iManage, Confluence, Jira, Salesforce, ServiceNow, Box, Teams.\n- **[[servicenow-connector]]** \u2014 ServiceNow KB, catalog, and incident crawling configuration.\n- **[[snowflake-renderer]]** \u2014 Snowflake ingestion, Cortex vector embedding support, and data lake indexing.\n\n### 3. Extensibility & Security\n- **[[connector-extensibility-and-scripting]]** \u2014 PowerShell CMDLETs, VB.NET transformation functions, metadata/security scripts.\n- **[[security-trimming-and-acls]]** \u2014 Early binding vs late binding security, ACL token normalization, Active Directory sync.\n"
