      "summary": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"Forward Deployed Engineer: The AI's Hottest Job Paying $280K to $1M+ (Full Course with resources)\"\ndomain: \"ai-and-intelligent-systems\"\ncategory: \"general\"\ntype: \"concept\"\ntags: \"newslett...",
