      "body": "# Projects Knowledge Base\n\nMap of Content (MOC) and central repository for specifications, architecture designs, and roadmaps across all software projects.\n\n---\n\n## Active Projects\n\n### 1. BlanketDesignGenerator\n* **Description**: Interactive web & mobile app for designing crochet/knitting blanket patterns, color palettes, border styling, and motif arrangements.\n* **Technical Spec**: [TECHNICAL_SPEC.md](BlanketDesignGenerator/TECHNICAL_SPEC.md)\n* **Roadmap**: [ROADMAP.md](BlanketDesignGenerator/ROADMAP.md)\n\n---\n\n### 2. FoodEx\n* **Description**: AI-powered grocery expiration and pantry inventory management assistant integrated with smart home workflows.\n* **Technical Spec**: [TECHNICAL_SPEC.md](FoodEx/TECHNICAL_SPEC.md)\n* **Roadmap**: [ROADMAP.md](FoodEx/ROADMAP.md)\n\n---\n\n### 3. georgemoraru.github.io\n* **Description**: Personal portfolio, showcase, and project landing site deployed to GitHub Pages.\n* **Technical Spec**: [TECHNICAL_SPEC.md](georgemoraru.github.io/TECHNICAL_SPEC.md)\n* **Roadmap**: [ROADMAP.md](georgemoraru.github.io/ROADMAP.md)\n\n---\n\n## Governance & Rules\n* [Global Development Rules](rules/global-development-rules.md)\n* [Universal AI Routing Rules](rules/universal-ai-routing.md)\n\n## Skills & SOPs\n* [Generate Technical Spec](skills/generate-technical-spec.md)\n* [Initialize Knowledge Base](skills/init-knowledge-base.md)"
