      "summary": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"Prompt Engineering Index\"\ndomain: \"prompt-engineering\"\ncategory: \"prompt-engineering\"\ntype: \"hub\"\ntags: \"index\", \"moc\", \"prompt-engineering\", \"llm\", \"vibe-coding\"\ncreated: 2026-08-17\nupda...",
