      "summary": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"SmartHub Knowledge Domain Index\"\ndomain: \"smarthub\"\ncategory: \"work\"\ntype: \"hub\"\ntags: \"smarthub\", \"index\", \"moc\"\ncreated: 2026-08-18\nupdated: 2026-08-18\nstatus: active\nsummary: \"Map of C...",
      "tags": [],
