      "summary": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"SmartHub SearchUI Component Development & Templating Guide\"\ndomain: \"work-projects\"\ncategory: \"projects\"\ntype: \"guide\"\ntags: \"smarthub\", \"searchui\", \"shframework\", \"components\", \"templati...",
