      "summary": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"SmartHub UI Framework & Layouts\"\ndomain: \"smarthub\"\ncategory: \"work\"\ntype: \"architecture\"\ntags: \"smarthub\", \"ui-framework\", \"layouts\", \"ui-editor\", \"templating\", \"javascript\"\ncreated: 202...",
