      "body": "\ufeff---\ntitle: \"SmartHub UI/UX Dark Mode & Performance Optimization Guide\"\ndomain: \"work-projects\"\ncategory: \"projects\"\ntype: \"spec\"\ntags: [\"smarthub\", \"dark-mode\", \"responsive-design\", \"performance\", \"conversational-search\", \"ttft\", \"sse-streaming\"]\ncreated: 2026-08-18\nupdated: 2026-08-18\nstatus: active\nsummary: \"Technical guide for SmartHub Dark Mode styling, 3-column responsive viewport adaptations (desktop, tablet, mobile), and end-to-end performance optimization strategies to reduce Conversational Search TTFT under 450ms.\"\nrelated:\n  - \"[[TECHNICAL_SPEC]]\"\n  - \"[[conversational-search-rag]]\"\n  - \"[[vector-hybrid-search]]\"\n  - \"[[searchui-architecture]]\"\n---\n\n# SmartHub UI/UX Dark Mode & Performance Optimization Guide\n\n---\n\n## 1. Dark Mode & Responsive Layout Architecture\n\n### 1.1 Color Palette & Theme Tokens\n- **Canvas / App Background**: Slate Navy (`#0f172a` / `#090d16`)\n- **Card & Panel Surfaces**: Dark Slate (`#1e293b` / `#162032`)\n- **Borders & Dividers**: Subtle Charcoal (`#334155` / `#1e293b`)\n- **Primary Text**: Off-White (`#f8fafc`)\n- **Muted / Secondary Text**: Slate Gray (`#94a3b8`)\n- **Interactive Accents / Citations**: Vibrant Cyan (`#06b6d4` / `#0ea5e9`)\n\n### 1.2 Multi-Viewport Breakpoint Strategy\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    Desktop[\"Desktop (\u22651200px)<br>Full 3-Column Grid<br>\u2022 Persistent Refiner Facets<br>\u2022 Center AI Chat Stream<br>\u2022 Right Related Documents\"]\n    \n    Tablet[\"Tablet (768px - 1199px)<br>2-Column / Collapsible Panel<br>\u2022 Left Navigation Icon Rail<br>\u2022 Fluid AI Chat Stream<br>\u2022 Slide-out Drawers\"]\n    \n    Mobile[\"Mobile (&lt;768px)<br>Single Fluid Column<br>\u2022 Sticky Header + Bottom Query Bar<br>\u2022 Floating '+ Refine Results' Sheet<br>\u2022 Bottom Drawer Previews\"]\n```\n\n| Viewport | Breakpoint | Layout Structure | Key Adaptations |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Desktop** | `\u2265 1200px` | 3-Column Grid (`sh-body-grid`) | Persistent left facet column, center conversation stream, right related documents panel. Independent vertical scrolling. |\n| **Tablet** | `768px \u2013 1199px` | 2-Column with Slide-out Drawer | Left facet sidebar collapses into an icon rail. Related documents panel opens as an overlay drawer. |\n| **Mobile** | `< 768px` | 1-Column Fluid Stack | Floating `+ Refine Results` modal bottom sheet. Query input bar pinned above mobile keyboard. Tap citations to open snippet bottom sheets. |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Conversational Search Performance Optimization Plan\n\n### 2.1 Target Latency Benchmarks\n\n| Pipeline Stage | Baseline / Bottleneck | Target Benchmark |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Query Embedding Vectorization** | 200 \u2013 350 ms | **0 ms (Cache Hit) / 80 ms** |\n| **Hybrid Search (Vector + BM25)** | 300 \u2013 500 ms | **120 \u2013 180 ms** |\n| **Context Assembly & Reranking** | 100 \u2013 200 ms | **30 \u2013 50 ms** |\n| **Time-to-First-Token (TTFT)** | 1,200 \u2013 2,500 ms | **< 450 ms** |\n| **Client UI Stream Rendering** | 15 \u2013 25 FPS (Stutter) | **60 FPS (Silky Smooth)** |\n\n---\n\n### 2.2 Frontend & Stream Rendering Optimizations (`SearchUI`)\n\n1. **`requestAnimationFrame` Token Buffering**:\n   - Avoid re-parsing markdown on every raw SSE character event.\n   - Buffer incoming delta tokens in memory and render via `requestAnimationFrame` (16ms throttle) or parse markdown on sentence/newline delimiters.\n2. **Parallel Rendering of Related Documents**:\n   - Decouple the right-hand Related Documents fetch from the conversational stream.\n   - Stream the LLM response immediately; fetch and populate related document previews in the background.\n\n---\n\n### 2.3 Backend Retrieval & Pipeline Optimizations (`Federator` / `ConversationalSearch`)\n\n1. **Parallel Vector & Lexical Execution**:\n   - Execute embedding generation and keyword search concurrently via `Task.WhenAll`:\n   ```csharp\n   var embeddingTask = _aiConnector.GetEmbeddingAsync(queryText);\n   var keywordSearchTask = _federatorEngine.SearchKeywordAsync(query);\n   await Task.WhenAll(embeddingTask, keywordSearchTask).ConfigureAwait(false);\n   ```\n2. **Query Embedding Cache**:\n   - In-memory LRU cache (`MemoryCache`) for normalized query embeddings. Skips external embedding API calls for frequent searches (~150ms saved).\n3. **Context Trimming & Token Budgeting**:\n   - Inject only the **top 3\u20135 dense reranked passages** (max 1,200 tokens) into prompt context instead of 10+ raw documents (3,000+ tokens).\n4. **HNSW Vector Search Index Tuning**:\n   - Configure `efSearch=100-200` in Azure AI Search / OpenSearch for sub-100ms k-NN retrieval with >98% recall.\n"
